// Title: Potential SolidPDFCreator.DLL Sideloading
// Sigma ID: a2edbce1-95c8-4291-8676-0d45146862b3
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-05-07 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: persistence, privilege-escalation, execution, stealth, T1574.001
// Description: Detects potential DLL sideloading of "SolidPDFCreator.dll"
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://lab52.io/blog/new-mustang-pandas-campaing-against-australia/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/adf5a626c4a776f3f023056f0f398b9523a2f09e/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_side_load_solidpdfcreator.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\SolidPDFCreator.dll" and (not((InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\SolidPDFCreator.exe" and (FolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\SolidDocuments\\SolidPDFCreator\\" or FolderPath startswith "C:\\Program Files\\SolidDocuments\\SolidPDFCreator\\"))))
